            <ArticleTitle>Aneurysmal subarachnoid hemorrhage in a child with leukemia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>144-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A child with acute lymphoblastic leukemia presented with an aneurysmal subarachnoid hemorrhage. The rationale for aggressively investigating leukemic children with headache and isolated oculomotor nerve palsy is outlined.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
